  "description": "Phones mode: an agent's phone GPUs become phone-<n>, laid out in their own image and never on the wall. claim_phone borrows one (one per client, a cap, a cooldown); phone_action accepts only the enumerated actions from the phone's viewer, at most one a second, and hands them to the agent with the phone's assignment, which names the viewer holding the phone (mirror_viewer, the only viewer the phone's GPU mirror opens for); reboot_phone, the end of a borrow and a viewer leaving each restore the phone's VM, timed from the click to its first frame. phones_zoom zooms every viewer's phones out or in together, one change every 2 s per client.",
